 `slugify(value)` converts display text into a lower-case, hyphen-separated slug.
 
-Example: `slugify("Hello World")` returns `hello-world`.
+Leading and trailing whitespace is ignored, and every run of internal
+whitespace becomes one hyphen. Example: `slugify("  Hello World  ")` returns
+`hello-world`.
